{"id":"C547af7ba4e6c18f54f2b","zh":"断轨","en":"rail breaking","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"钢轨发生断裂的病害状态。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"在钢轨病害原因分析中作为断裂事件的研究对象，现有用法主要关注焊接接头处发生的断轨及其原因。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C547af7ba4e6c18f54f2b","zh":"断轨","en":"rail breaking","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"H293337105b88ddfa178d","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 陈宪麦等（2015）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D305f09b7731c8531cc6d","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"断轨"},{"id":"D2583188ac89e72441790","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"rail breaking"}],"sources":{"P104":{"id":"P104","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","authors":"陈宪麦,贺天龙,刘胜勇,张向民,徐磊,马子祥,王卫东","year":"2015","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2015.06.007","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2015）","overview_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sdc3594ef75bdd7f7c366","source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"With the methods of site investigation, testing and calculation analysis, useful discussions of rail wear, Sanzhe, rail breaking and initial deflection, parameters of fastener and rail joint bolt torque, service state and geometric parameters of ballast bed, cold damage, track irregularity, are proposed.","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S7da49049888362783e66","source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"采用现场调研、测试和计算分析等研究方法,对滨洲线的钢轨磨耗、三折、断轨和原始弯曲,扣件参数及接头螺栓扭矩,道床状态参数和几何参数,线路冻害和轨道不平顺等线路状态进行深入分析,总结滨洲线轨道状态之特征和变化规律,并提出养护维修之对策。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S40f8a171428ba0b0edbd","source_id":"P104","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"1.3 断轨在复杂的气候条件下,由于钢轨受到列车荷载冲击碾压、热胀冷缩等因素的影响,在冬、春季拉应力增大的情况下,断轨现象在各个铁路局都有不同程度的发生,尤其是严寒地区 [7 -8]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C375215c4a3112e120cd1","target_concept_id":"C375215c4a3112e120cd1","target_zh":"接头螺栓扭矩","target_en":"rail joint bolt torque","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C0f671887c4151b3e46fc","target_concept_id":"C0f671887c4151b3e46fc","target_zh":"原始弯曲","target_en":"initial deflection","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C20a250d00d217006057c","target_concept_id":"C20a250d00d217006057c","target_zh":"运营状态","target_en":"service state","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cf50644019af4da5a2a8a","target_concept_id":"Cf50644019af4da5a2a8a","target_zh":"养护维修","target_en":"maintenance","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C21783a05396572128faa","target_concept_id":"C21783a05396572128faa","target_zh":"钢轨磨耗","target_en":"rail wear","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P104","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","authors":"陈宪麦,贺天龙,刘胜勇,张向民,徐磊,马子祥,王卫东","year":"2015","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2015.06.007","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2015）","overview_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway"}]}